ide |   length of long side | |------------|----------------|------------------------|-------------------------|-----------------------| |            |              1 |                      4 |                       5 |                     7 | |            |              2 |                        |                         |                       | |            |              3 |                        |                         |                       | | triangle   | (long side) (short side)   | (long side) (medium side)   | (medium side) (short side)   | |------------|----------------------------|-----------------------------|------------------------------| |            | or 1.75                    | or 1.4                      | or 1.25                      | What do you notice about the quotients? 3. Compare your results with your partners' and complete your table."),extraction_status(blocked_missing_visual),blocker(expression_missing_from_markdown),visual_provenance([visual_source(asset('hermes/app/runtime/experiments/gemma4_tutor/docling/full-output/TeacherLessonGuides/Grade8/Grade8-2-9-Lesson-teacher-guide-/document_artifacts/image_000029_e3c6891d4d038901b2447e7eb9b5e174182e3be55b8864ad03094569f739daee.png'),description_file('hermes/app/runtime/experiments/gemma4_tutor/docling/full-output/TeacherLessonGuides/Grade8/Grade8-2-9-Lesson-teacher-guide-/picture_descriptions.md'),model('ibm-granite/granite-vision-3.3-2b (auto_inline)')),visual_source(asset('hermes/app/runtime/experiments/gemma4_tutor/docling/full-output/TeacherLessonGuides/Grade8/Grade8-2-9-Lesson-teacher-guide-/document_artifacts/image_000030_65699ee8d8047808ce67b138105317378551e76c427fb4551d43c4f3be7a8bd4.png'),description_file('hermes/app/runtime/experiments/gemma4_tutor/docling/full-output/TeacherLessonGuides/Grade8/Grade8-2-9-Lesson-teacher-guide-/picture_descriptions.md'),model('ibm-granite/granite-vision-3.3-2b (auto_inline)'))]))}).

