. It is important to be very precise! Be careful, work in pencil, and use a straightedge. 3. Find the point where the 2 lines intersect each other. What are the coordinates of this point? 4. How can you check your coordinates using the equations? 5. What do the coordinates mean in this situation? 6. What has to be true about the relationship between these coordinates and Jada's equation? 7. What has to be true about the relationship between these coordinates and Han's equation?"),extraction_status(blocked_missing_visual),blocker(expression_missing_from_markdown),visual_provenance([visual_source(asset('hermes/app/runtime/experiments/gemma4_tutor/docling/full-output/TeacherLessonGuides/Grade8/Grade8-4-12-Lesson-teacher-guide-/document_artifacts/image_000029_0f88499f2cc45fc6a06d1524f37d340e389814497a5fa2a1d79956324ef4018b.png'),description_file('hermes/app/runtime/experiments/gemma4_tutor/docling/full-output/TeacherLessonGuides/Grade8/Grade8-4-12-Lesson-teacher-guide-/picture_descriptions.md'),model('ibm-granite/granite-vision-3.3-2b (auto_inline)')),visual_source(asset('hermes/app/runtime/experiments/gemma4_tutor/docling/full-output/TeacherLessonGuides/Grade8/Grade8-4-12-Lesson-teacher-guide-/document_artifacts/image_000030_65699ee8d8047808ce67b138105317378551e76c427fb4551d43c4f3be7a8bd4.png'),description_file('hermes/app/runtime/experiments/gemma4_tutor/docling/full-output/TeacherLessonGuides/Grade8/Grade8-4-12-Lesson-teacher-guide-/picture_descriptions.md'),model('ibm-granite/granite-vision-3.3-2b (auto_inline)')),visual_source(asset('hermes/app/runtime/experiments/gemma4_tutor/docling/full-output/TeacherLessonGuides/Grade8/Grade8-4-12-Lesson-teacher-guide-/document_artifacts/image_000031_2ecbb1b0192f28696342c2b0c812cf2370b5495d7eabf9bbab9f47dc306b6129.png'),description_file('hermes/app/runtime/experiments/gemma4_tutor/docling/full-output/TeacherLessonGuides/Grade8/Grade8-4-12-Lesson-teacher-guide-/picture_descriptions.md'),model('ibm-granite/granite-vision-3.3-2b (