l number of those creatures on Earth. Use the table to answer each question, and explain or show your reasoning. | creature        | total number   | mass of one individual (kg)   | |-----------------|----------------|-------------------------------| | humans          |                |                               | | cows            |                |                               | | sheep           |                |                               | | chickens        |                |                               | | ants            |                |                               | | blue whales     |                |                               | | antarctic krill |                |                               | | zooplankton     |                |                               | | bacteria        |                |                               | 1. On a farm there was a cow. And on the farm there were 2 sheep. There were also 3 chickens. What is the total mass of the 1 cow, the 2 sheep, the 3 chickens, and the 1 farmer on the farm? 2. What is the total mass of a human, a blue whale, and 6 ants all together? 3. Which is greater, the number of bacteria, or the number of all the other animals in the table put together?"),extraction_status(complete),blocker(none),visual_provenance([]))}).

